cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it using the metadata below."

type: dataset

title: "Ecuadorian Credit Risk and Borrower Behavior Dataset"

abstract: >-
  This dataset contains 198,800 anonymized credit observations from
  Ecuador's cooperative and financial sector, covering consumer and
  microcredit products. It supports credit-risk research, including
  the prediction of adverse credit performance over a 12-month horizon,
  feature selection, temporal validation, and model explainability.

